# Provider binary
terraform-provider-pathly
terraform-provider-pathly.exe
dist/

# Coverage: `go test -cover` also leaves instrumented binaries behind.
cov*

# Terraform state and cache of the examples: the state holds the ids of the
# resources that were created, and for a webhook its signing secret.
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Local variables: they often carry the API key.
*.auto.tfvars
terraform.tfvars
.env

